Source: https://github.com/xiph/ogg/tree/v1.3.6/include/ogg
License: BSD-3-Clause; see COPYING.ogg.
config_types.h supplies the fixed-width C integer types for these headers.

Local change: decode.c and decint.h support suspending at stripe callbacks
so guest continuations can run before decoding the following stripe.
Independent native planes may share two persistent workers, joining before
frame publication. Scalar decoding remains available as the test oracle.
